Package: pico-fan
Maintainer: albeph
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9),
 python3-serial,
 lm-sensors,
 udev
Recommends: minicom
Description: USB fan control via Raspberry Pi Pico CLI and daemon
 pico-fan-control manages a 4-pin fan connected to a Raspberry Pi Pico
 via USB CDC serial interface. Features include:
 .
  - MicroPython firmware for RP2040 (25 kHz PWM + interrupt tachometer)
  - Unified CLI interface with real-time diagnostics and manual override
  - Background RPM synchronization daemon
  - Interactive configuration wizard
  - Full systemd and udev integration
 .
 The external fan automatically synchronizes with internal system fan RPM
 (supporting ThinkPad ACPI and generic hwmon).
